/T (In this context, our project is not merely a course assignment but a comprehensive practice of full-stack development. It fully integrates front-end responsive design, back-end API and database management, and user authentication and security mechanisms, comprehensively covering the learning outcomes of the course. Team members will collaborate, each responsible for different aspects: UI design, authentication and search functionality, database schema and logging system, and will employ agile methodologies for iterative development and testing.)
